{
  "_readme": "Wappa 5 performance presets (pack defaults baked into wappatweaks). This file is copied to config/wappatweaks/presets.json on first launch; edit that copy in-game (Mods > Wappa Tweaks > Config > Edit Presets) or by hand - it always wins over the baked-in defaults. Each preset: disabledMods (jar filename globs, silently skipped by the loader; files never touched), options (options.txt key->value patches, applied next launch). Files under config/wappatweaks/presets/<id>/overlay/ are copied over the game dir on next launch.",
